data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_part.done","sequence_number":109,"item_id":"rs_0466d78deb473c8b016ac91de25134819683aa7427e2aeb4f5","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"part":{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Implementing API and Testing**\n\nI'm thinking about how I need to implement simple API front files and do some built-in tests. I've got enough time for that. I'll want to ensure the text content is safe and handle database management properly, like creating default directories for data. I need to address request limits and errors, and make IDs autoincrement. Also, should I consider using navigation anchors or buttons for location assignment? I could load routes on page load when clicking on Projects. Alright, let's serve static content cautiously and prepare for some tests!"}}

